  "body": "Perched in a prime Torbay coastal location, these stunning brand-new homes offer modern luxury, sea views, and effortless family living across three spacious levels.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 4 generous bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, multiple living areas, and a versatile study/media room, these homes are thoughtfully designed with light-filled interiors, quality finishes, internal-access garaging, and additional off-street parking. The master suite enjoys expansive windows with beautiful coastal outlooks.\r\n\r\nComplete with a 10-Year Stamford Warranty, these homes are perfectly positioned close to beautiful beaches, local cafes, quality schools, parks, shopping amenities, and easy motorway access, with the beach just a short 2-minute walk away - delivering the perfect balance of relaxed coastal living and modern practicality\r\n\r\nCall now to arrange your private viewing.",
